{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#136","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#136","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#136\",\"parent_revision\":\"96a3106126a7afcdaa2252eedc6196545d4d8800e6503ddca014f5a4b1465255\",\"root_revision\":\"96a3106126a7afcdaa2252eedc6196545d4d8800e6503ddca014f5a4b1465255\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: closed\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Problem\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nNothing loads `packages/skilllint/schemas/provenance-registry.json` or `opinion-catalog.json`. They are data files with no reader, so nothing checks that what they assert is true.\\n\\nThe cost showed up immediately during #102's review: **four locators pointed at symbols that do not exist or are wrong.**\\n\\n- `HookValidator.VALID_EVENT_TYPES` \u2014 not a symbol\\n- `HookValidator.VALID_HOOK_TYPES` \u2014 not a symbol\\n- FM007's `symbol` was prose naming line 417; the constant was at 415\\n- SK004's claim pointed at a parallel `1024` literal rather than the one in force\\n\\nAll four were caught by a human reviewer reading JSON, not by any gate.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Fix\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nA test that imports every `python_constant` locator in the registry and asserts it resolves. The agent that found this estimates ~15 lines. It would have caught all four.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Wider Point\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nA registry asserting provenance it cannot verify is weaker than no registry, because it reads as authoritative. This is the same shape as #130 (catalog rows disagreeing with the enum) and #124 (stubs drifting from emitters): a file claiming something true about the code with nothing enforcing the claim.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Related\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- #102 \u2014 where the four broken locators were found\\n- #112 \u2014 the architecture spec for this registry\\n- #124, #130 \u2014 same class\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"3616d13719826365975f62914f3380543015dfe6b5e97af6cfb12df79d4e47ff\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDORXxKvc8AAAABXP-zVA\"}"}